Parts of this repository are NOT under that licence, and carry their own:

  data/images/** and docs/images/**
      each picture carries its own licence in its record and on the page that shows
      it: CC0, public domain, CC BY, CC BY-SA, the Free Art Licence, or a "no known
      copyright restrictions" rights statement from the holding institution. None of
      them is relicensed by this repository.

  quoted text
      every quotation on this site is short, in quotation marks, and attributed to a
      named speaker or a named publication, as fair dealing / fair use. Nothing here
      reproduces a copyrighted work at length.

  the drawn signs (tools/viz.py GLYPHS, and the figure, house, car and boat on /wear/)
      drawn for this project from published descriptions, not traced from any one
      object or from anybody else's drawing. They are CC BY-SA 4.0 with the records.

Country outlines in data/geo/world.json: Natural Earth, 1:110m, public domain.
https://www.naturalearthdata.com/

Some of the material this atlas describes is restricted by the traditions it belongs
to. Where that is so, the record carries a `restricted` block and the detail is absent
by design. A licence permitting reuse of these records is not permission to fill that
absence from elsewhere, and this project asks that reusers keep the restriction with
the record it belongs to.

